  "finding": {
    "severity": "P2",
    "status": "fixed",
    "title": "Evaluate unused ordinary scene containers every frame",
    "cause": "The new parent-before-child container index included ordinary groups with neither part descendants nor offscreen-layer descendants. createInheritedResolver evaluated their render properties every frame.",
    "impact": "Additional per-frame work scales with valid unused scene groups and delays applying visible controls. It does not change the render plan.",
    "reproduction": "Valid parsed documents with 100, 1000 and 5000 unused ordinary scene groups. A focused regression assertion failed before the fix and passed after it.",
    "fix": "Retain only ancestors of scene parts and offscreen layers, including empty offscreen layers themselves. Preserve scene traversal order so retained parents precede their children.",
